{"asset_key":"ep7/herohub_story_17411260","episode":"ep7","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"17411260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1741126001:1":{"text":"은월관에 들어가는 방법... 꽤 독특하지 않소?","source_cn":"进入霁月会馆的方法……很别致吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BCE3C8DD765EF25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1741126002:1":{"text":"이렇게 설계한 이유는...","source_cn":"至于这样设计的考量……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x594F01D812D1205D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1741126003:1":{"text":"비밀은 그림자 속에서 자라나야 하고, 거래는 고요함 속에서 이루어져야 하는 법이기 때문이오.","source_cn":"秘密需要阴影来滋养，交易需要静谧来达成。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5AAE0342CE63204","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1741126004:1":{"text":"온갖 노력을 들여 수많은 시험을 통과해서라도 들어오려는 사람들은, 대개 강렬한 욕망을 품고 있다는 뜻이지...","source_cn":"更重要的是，那些愿意费尽心思、通过层层考验也要进来的人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB59E545B7A9F9CAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1741126005:1":{"text":"그리고 그런 사람이야말로 비밀에게 잡아먹히는 것이 아니라... 비밀을 올바르게 사용할 줄 아는 법이라오.","source_cn":"也只有这样的人，才懂得如何正确地使用这些秘密，而不是…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE2227638C779892","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1741126006:1":{"text":"비밀의 달콤한 맛을 한번 알고 나면... 자연히 내게 더 많은 비밀을 바치게 될 테니...","source_cn":"对秘密的甜美食髓知味后……他们自会为我奉上更多的秘密。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94BFBF0E8AD83427","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:埃德加":{"text":"에린도르","source":"埃德加","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":1}}